cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "humans.top — global humans influence ranking (open dataset)"
abstract: >-
  An open, continuously updated ranking of notable living people, ordered by a
  fixed composite of political, financial, informational and cultural influence
  computed from public statistical sources. Each entry has a concise descriptor
  in 15 languages, Wikidata / VIAF / ISNI identifiers, an influence tier, the
  live rank, demographics, and a canonical profile URL.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "humans.top"
    website: "https://humans.top"
url: "https://humans.top/dataset"
repository: "https://github.com/dsfox-idea/humans-top"
license: CC0-1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20809207
keywords:
  - influential people
  - people ranking
  - influence
  - notable people
  - multilingual
  - entity linking
  - wikidata
  - knowledge base
